<div class="screen flex flex-col px-3.5 pt-1.5 pb-3" data-screen="doctor">
  <p class="text-[17px] leading-tight font-bold tracking-tight">Plant doctor</p>
  <div class="relative mt-3 aspect-[4/3] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-base-200">
    <img src="/media/leaf-yellowing.jpg" class="size-full object-cover">
    <span class="absolute inset-3" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="absolute top-0 left-0 size-5 rounded-tl-lg border-t-[3px] border-l-[3px] border-base-100"></span>
      <span class="absolute top-0 right-0 size-5 rounded-tr-lg border-t-[3px] border-r-[3px] border-base-100"></span>
      <span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 size-5 rounded-bl-lg border-b-[3px] border-l-[3px] border-base-100"></span>
      <span class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 size-5 rounded-br-lg border-r-[3px] border-b-[3px] border-base-100"></span>
    </span>
    <span class="scan-line scan-sweep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-3 rounded-2xl bg-accent/45 p-2.5">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
      <p class="text-[13px] font-bold">Likely overwatering</p>
      <p class="rounded-full bg-base-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold">82% sure</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-2 h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-base-100"><div class="h-full w-[82%] rounded-full bg-primary"></div></div>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wide text-base-content/60 uppercase">This week</p>
  <ol class="mt-1.5 space-y-1.5 text-[11px]">
    <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="grid size-4 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-[9px] font-bold">1</span>Let the top 3 cm of soil dry out.</li>
    <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="grid size-4 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-[9px] font-bold">2</span>Check that the pot drains freely.</li>
    <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="grid size-4 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-[9px] font-bold">3</span>Cut off the leaves that are fully yellow.</li>
  </ol>
</div>
